SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Santanera: El Quinto Aniversario Celebration
LOCATION:Santanera
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, 19 November 2026\, Canggu’s beloved Latin Ameri
 can dining hotspot Santanera celebrates a new milestone with its fifth ann
 iversary: El Quinto Aniversario . The celebration reunites founding chefs 
 Andrés Becerra and Germ án Rinc ón for an evening of shared plates\, fl
 oral installations and immersive performances\, transitioning from dinner 
 to a rooftop fiesta. At Santanera\, a plate’s arrival at the table means
  an invitation to taste\, exchange impressions\, and pass it along. The ex
 perience is shaped by its vibrant Latin American flavours\, generous hospi
 tality\, and the pleasure of gathering. With El Quinto Aniversario \, Sant
 anera will express greater pride in its roots through cooking\, flowers\, 
 music and dance. Returning from his Spanish restaurant\, Tinto\, in Melbou
 rne\, fellow founding chef Germán Rincón reunites with founding chef And
 rés Becerra to create a menu designed to share. The much-awaited reunion 
 brings two culinary journeys back into the same kitchen\, drawing on a sha
 red foundation and the experiences they’ve gathered individually along t
 he way.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/santanera-
 el-quinto-aniversario-celebration/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer bef
 ore attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/santanera-el-quinto-aniversar
 io-celebration/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
END:VEVENT
