SUMMARY:Sheraton Bali Kuta Resort Presents Finish-Line Maxxing Run &More
LOCATION:Sheraton Bali Kuta Resort
DESCRIPTION:On Sunday\, 22 November 2026\, Sheraton Bali Kuta Resort will g
 ather Bali’s running community\, hotel guests and local residents as the
 y present Finish-Line Maxxing Run &More. The event combines active lifesty
 le\, local culinary experiences\, sustainable craftsmanship and community 
 giving. Finish-Line Maxxing Run &More welcomes amateur to experienced runn
 ers to join a fun 5K social run \, followed by a Coffee Rave Party at &Mor
 e by Sheraton . Collaborating with the Erez Enterprize Community\, the eve
 nt will see up to 100 participants on a morning that combines running\, co
 ffee\, food and music. In addition to the gathering\, the activation is or
 ganised to support a neighbouring elementary school in Legian through a cl
 othing donation initiative and to showcase gift bags created from repurpos
 ed hotel linen in collaboration with Tarum Bali and local artisans. Finish
 -LineMaxxing taps into Indonesia’s growing run club trend\, and instead 
 of establishing new running groups\, Sheraton hotels decide to partner wit
 h existing clubs\, turning the post-run cooldown into a social gathering f
 ocused on recovery and coffee culture. Hosted by Mika Affandy and Dominic 
 Hulme \, the morning commences with a casual 5K social run through Kuta an
 d Legian starting at 6am \, before reconvening at the resort for a post-ru
 n gathering until 10am .\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-
 events/sheraton-bali-kuta-resort-presents-finish-line-maxxing-run-more/\n\
 nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/sheraton-bali-kuta-resort-pre
 sents-finish-line-maxxing-run-more/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
